# Agent Chat Reasoning Entry

## Metadata

```yaml
format: uimd
format-version: 1
kind: component
status: draft
description: "Animated Heron-style thinking and status message."
tags: [component, simulation, reasoning]
```

## Definition

```yaml
extends: uicontrol
```

## Members

```yaml
heading:
  type: label
  text: "Thinking"
  description: "Animated thinking or activity phase."

body:
  type: spanlabel
  text: ""
  description: "Visible simulated reasoning detail."
```

## Style

```yaml
this:
  border-width: 0
  background: "#00000000"
@panel:
  background: "#00000000"
  padding: 0, 1, 0, 1
@heading:
  color: "#e5e7eb"
  text-color-gradient:
    interval: 90
    step: 1
    segment-size: 1
    colors: ["#000000aa", "#00000077", "#00000044", "#00000011", "#00000000", "#00000000", "#00000000", "#00000000", "#00000011", "#00000044", "#00000077", "#000000aa"]
@body:
  color: "#94a3b8"
  word-wrap: true
  user-select: text
```

